# ---------- COEF
q("COEF", "The lift formula is:", ["L = ½ ρ V² S CL", "L = ½ ρ V S CL", "L = ρ V² S CL", "L = ½ ρ V² CL / S"], "Portance = ½ ρ V² S CL. V au carré : vitesse × 2 donne portance × 4.")
q("COEF", "The lift coefficient CL mainly depends on:", ["Angle of attack and airfoil shape", "Air density and true airspeed", "Wing area and aircraft weight", "Altitude and air temperature"], "CL dépend du profil et surtout de l'incidence. ρ, V et S sont à part dans la formule.")
q("COEF", "If speed is doubled at constant CL and density, lift is:", ["Multiplied by 4", "Multiplied by 2", "Divided by 2", "Multiplied by 1.41"], "V est au carré dans la formule.")
q("COEF", "The centre of pressure is:", ["Where the total aerodynamic force acts", "Where the pitching moment never changes", "Where the aircraft weight is applied", "The point of maximum airfoil thickness"], "Point d'application de la résultante aérodynamique.")
q("COEF", "The aerodynamic centre is the point where:", ["The pitching moment is constant with AoA", "The total aerodynamic force is applied", "The boundary layer becomes turbulent", "The airflow first reaches Mach 1"], "Le foyer, vers 25 % de la corde : le moment ne varie pas avec l'incidence.")
q("COEF", "As AoA increases (below the stall), the centre of pressure:", ["Moves forward", "Moves aft", "Stays fixed", "Moves to the tip"], "Le CP avance quand l'incidence augmente, puis recule brutalement au décrochage.")
q("COEF", "The aerodynamic centre of a subsonic airfoil is at about:", ["25 % of the chord", "50 % of the chord", "10 % of the chord", "75 % of the chord"], "")
q("COEF", "Lift is defined as the component of the aerodynamic force:", ["Perpendicular to the relative airflow", "Perpendicular to the aircraft longitudinal axis", "Parallel to the relative airflow", "Opposite to the aircraft weight"], "La traînée est parallèle au vent relatif.")
q("COEF", "In steady level flight, when speed decreases, the pilot must:", ["Increase the AoA to keep lift equal to weight", "Decrease the AoA to keep lift equal to weight", "Increase lift so it becomes greater than weight", "Keep the same AoA because lift does not change"], "En palier, portance = poids. Moins de V² se compense par plus de CL, donc plus d'incidence.")
q("COEF", "The lift/drag ratio is called:", ["Glide ratio (finesse)", "Aspect ratio (b² / S)", "Taper ratio of the wing", "Load factor (lift / W)"], "")

# ---------- DRAG
q("DRAG", "Induced drag:", ["Decreases when speed increases", "Increases when speed increases", "Does not depend on speed", "Is maximum at high speed"], "Elle varie en 1/V² : forte à basse vitesse, à forte incidence.")
